  "overview": "当父母的财政问题威胁到了Ashley上大学的梦想时，这个高中生决定自己来解决这个问题。她和她的朋友们将她们的保姆工作变成了为奶爸们开放的三陪服务，并大获成功。但在这个郊外的小社区里，没有什么秘密，并且FBI也开始调查这个组织…… When her parents' financial problems threaten Ashley's dreams for college, the high school whiz kid takes matters into her own hands. S he and her girlfriends turn their babysitting business into a wildly successful escort service for dads. But in this small suburban community, nothing stays secret for long, and the FBI descends on the organization. Inspired by true events...",
